  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Current Unity version 2019.4.31f1 has a minor PlasticSCM editor window issue. The problem occurs when entering the 'O' letter by pressing Shift+O, that cause Unity trying to open the selected asset by external editor. This issue does not reproduce in Unity 2019.4.36f1 the latest 2019LTS version.\nWe can't use PlasticSCM effectively in Unity editor due to this issue.\nWe want to use PlasticSCM to version control VRChat world and avatar assets. Can we use the latest 2019LTS soon?",
